ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  Thus endeth the adventures of Stoqaxoqtl for this year.


  Your Majesty, I have news to report of wanderers in our kingdom:  
  Reynald (#31) hiked into Texas.  He had grown bored with Southern Rockies 
and was attracted there by tales of its fine wines and even finer 
courtesans.


  Here is the financial report for Stoqaxoqtl's kingdom: this turn, the 
Kingdom collected 0 gold in revenue.  0 gold was expended to finance our 
leaders.  0 gold was expended to maintain our armies.  Stoqaxoqtl was left 
with 10 gold in the treasury.


LETTER REPORTS

  O King of Kings, thy heroes have travelled around the globe in
search of adventure and conquest.  I have faithfully kept their
correspondence, and now I present it to thee:


From: Tattoo, Squire to Ilmarinen
To: Stoqaxoqtl

  Honored Sovereign, 

  Frigid winter gave way to fragrant spring, and Ilmarinen made ready to 
carry out his imperial assignments.  He prepared his armies to defend Texas 
and the surrounding provinces.

  Thy humble servant,   Tattoo, Squire to Ilmarinen


